  "@type": "schema:Dataset",
  "schema:name": "SAS Institute API JSON-LD context",
  "schema:description": "A JSON-LD @context for the objects SAS Institute's own API contract declares: one class per component schema, one property per declared field, typed from the contract. Derived by script (derive-json-ld.py, 2026-10-04) from openapi/sas-business-rules-api-openapi.yml, openapi/sas-cas-api-openapi.yml, openapi/sas-decisions-api-openapi.yml.",
